## Checklist

### Required for All PRs

- [ ] Code follows project style guidelines (`golangci-lint` passes)
- [ ] Self-review completed
- [ ] Tests added/updated for changes
- [ ] Documentation updated if needed

### Backwards Compatibility

- [ ] **No breaking changes** to CLI flags or commands
- [ ] **No breaking changes** to generated manifest format
- [ ] **No breaking changes** to template input format
- [ ] If breaking: migration path documented in PR description

### Determinism Check

- [ ] Generated manifests produce **identical output** for same input
- [ ] No timestamps, random values, or execution-time data in output
- [ ] Template changes include updated golden test snapshots

### Security Check

- [ ] **No secrets, credentials, or API keys** in code or config
- [ ] No `kubectl apply -f <remote-url>` patterns added
- [ ] New dependencies reviewed for security
- [ ] Secret references use `ref:secret.key` format only

### Install Profile Impact

- [ ] Verified `--profile=demo` still works end-to-end
- [ ] Verified `--profile=core` still works if affected
- [ ] New components added to correct profile (not `core` unless essential)
- [ ] Component versions pinned in `internal/versions/`

### CLI Changes (if applicable)

- [ ] New flags follow naming conventions (`--verbose`, `--dry-run`, etc.)
- [ ] Help text updated and includes examples
- [ ] Error messages include remediation steps
- [ ] Exit codes follow conventions

### GitOps Changes (if applicable)

- [ ] ArgoCD Application naming follows `{service}-{env}` pattern
- [ ] Required labels and annotations present
- [ ] Namespace follows `env-{name}` or `preview-{name}` pattern
- [ ] Ingress hosts follow `{service}.{env}.localhost` pattern

